{
  "slug": "solofounder",
  "name": "Solofounder",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Key features:\n- Clarifies before acting: asks questions with options and recommendations before designing any workflow\n- Dynamic flow composition: no templates, every workflow generated fresh for your specific request\n- Specialist roles, not generic agents: \"ASP.NET 10 + EF Core 10 Backend Specialist\" instead of \"Backend Agent\"\n- Structured artifacts with completion checklists at every stage\n- Conflict resolution through generated arbiters\n- Cross-project learning that compounds over time\n- Visual design research with Dribbble/Behance curation and interactive mockup server\n- Live research: verifies every tech recommendation against current documentation\n- Five Iron Laws: no fallbacks, no silent failures, everything reviewed and verified",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `conversation-analysis` (Use after every completed flow — analyzes the entire conversation to identify improvements, updates cross-project learning, and generates…), `flow-composer` (Use when any user request arrives — analyzes the request, designs the optimal flow of stages with specialist…), `role-generator` (Use after a flow is approved — generates specialist role definitions with domain-specific expertise, review checklists, and exception…), `using-solofounder` (Use when starting any conversation — bootstraps the SoloFounder system, loads Iron Laws, injects cross-project learning, and hands…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install solofounder@claude-community` from `solofounder-ai/solofounder`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 4,
    "hook": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
